                                  Table "public.bank_transfers"
     Column      |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |           Default           
-----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+-----------------------------
 id              | uuid                     |           | not null | gen_random_uuid()
 from_account_id | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 to_account_id   | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 amount          | numeric(15,2)            |           | not null | 
 description     | text                     |           |          | 
 transfer_date   | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()
 created_at      | timestamp with time zone |           |          | now()
 cheque_id       | uuid                     |           |          | 
 transfer_type   | character varying(50)    |           |          | 'manual'::character varying
Indexes:
    "bank_transfers_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "idx_bank_transfers_cheque" btree (cheque_id)
    "idx_bank_transfers_date" btree (transfer_date DESC)
    "idx_bank_transfers_from_account" btree (from_account_id)
    "idx_bank_transfers_to_account" btree (to_account_id)
Check constraints:
    "bank_transfers_amount_check" CHECK (amount > 0::numeric)
    "bank_transfers_transfer_type_check" CHECK (transfer_type::text = ANY (ARRAY['manual'::character varying, 'cheque_deposit'::character varying, 'expense'::character varying]::text[]))
    "different_accounts" CHECK (from_account_id <> to_account_id)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "bank_transfers_cheque_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (cheque_id) REFERENCES cheques(id)
    "bank_transfers_from_account_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (from_account_id) REFERENCES bank_accounts(id)
    "bank_transfers_to_account_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (to_account_id) REFERENCES bank_accounts(id)

